        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D26860 Egg Door Knob Entry Door Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia decorative egg door knobset can be used on both residential and commercial entry doors. It is made for doors that require a secure locking mechanism. The Egg Door Knob Entry Door Locksets is built to withstand heavy use, combining precision engineering for security and durability with an attractive design. The Oval backplate features a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screw-less outside plates.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <a href=\"/collections/omnia-tubular-entrysets\"><b>Omnia Entry Door Locksets</b></a> are available in over 30 different styles. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door knobs. backplates, latches, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D26860 Egg Knob Entry Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Height 10-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and knob latch): 3-5/8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1 3/4\" - 2\" Thick Doors (Contact us if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-Drilled Doors, 2-1/8\" Bore Holes</li>\r\n<li>Will Fit Narrow Stiles (3-5/8\" with 2-3/8\" Backset Latches)</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Egg Knobs and Trim</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard \"C\" keyway supplied with two nickel silver keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair</b>: Stationary both sides of door. Fixed knobs, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry</b>: Latchbolt operates by knob from either side. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry</b>: Latchbolt operates by knob from either side. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omnia Oval Plate Egg Knob Entry Door Lockset, Omnia D26860",
                "description": "Omnia D26860 Entry Door Locksets -- Omnia Egg Knob with Oval back plates available in 7 different finishes including Satin Nickel, Vintage Copper, Vintage Brass, Vintage Iron and Oil Rubbed Bronze.This Omnia decorative egg door knobset can be used on both residential and commercial entry doors. It is made for doors that require a secure locking mechanism. The Egg Door Knob Entry Door Locksets is built to withstand heavy use, combining precision engineering for security and durability with an attractive design. The Oval backplate features a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screw less outside plates.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-D26860 Omnia Oval Plate Egg Knob Entry Door Locksets, Omnia D26860 Entry Door Locksets, omnia deadbolt locks, omnia front door deadbolts,  omnia #860 door knobs, omnia 860 knobs, egg knobs, egg door knobs,"
